      "category": "DerivedDataCachePolicy",
      "signature": "CombineCachePolicy(A, B)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "A",
          "type": "ECachePolicy"
        },
        {
          "name": "B",
          "type": "ECachePolicy"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "ECachePolicy",
      "docs": "Returns a cache policy that encompasses the operations requested by the both arguments.\nExamples:\n- (Local, Remote | SkipData) -> Default\n- (Default, Local | SkipMeta) -> Default\n- (Query, StoreRemote) -> Query | StoreRemote"
